    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 49,
        "text": "Hi, Tom. You look worried. What's going on?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "6d778521b673f020144ae1f837578055130845a60ebfc38161c8ff640e2cb2d7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 55,
        "sourceEnd": 191,
        "text": "It's the new performance system. My manager, Rachel, wants us to log every task we do. She says it will help us measure outcomes better.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "39d48c8722e26eedcad2e39c65757594d0e15e3d775541d3a2155166975f8855",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 198,
        "sourceEnd": 241,
        "text": "That sounds reasonable. What's the problem?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "cb4cbb30c87a8180c5427702b165f28314839a6e7372184f04f092ad1ea32736",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 247,
        "sourceEnd": 388,
        "text": "The problem is that we spend more time logging than working. Yesterday I spent forty minutes filling in a form about a ten-minute phone call.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "f4936a00af09cfdaf9589f8afed57395eadf9769d3542b5593ff4111b953ff52",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 395,
        "sourceEnd": 452,
        "text": "Oh, I see. So the measurement itself is slowing you down.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "33ba3b4501d107ca051f6b7c9375a19af0bdcbe1b8cdd30a42faa55e36ce9337",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 458,
        "sourceEnd": 609,
        "text": "Exactly. And because we're all busy logging, we've stopped helping each other. Last week, I didn't help a new colleague because I was behind on my log.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "df5303337bd91009f7dce619a6e111298bbdb8f6249a940138199ee9ea5bf71e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 616,
        "sourceEnd": 702,
        "text": "That's a real cost. But if you don't measure anything, how do you know what's working?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "6910703d42635a1258386df91e0573ab05bd4f1b650a3e3da04f58a6a810c72a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 708,
        "sourceEnd": 878,
        "text": "I agree we need some measurement. But the current system only counts quantity, not quality. For example, it counts how many calls we make, not how well we solve problems.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "8f0722318f47c11905ab975fa06e724713f29f25a7795611ba7be3018fdbcd9d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 885,
        "sourceEnd": 928,
        "text": "So the numbers don't show the full picture.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "4a4f7f8fccf9569084ab52fb7cefa9d98f897fb803036a0decbb744db6b774d9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 934,
        "sourceEnd": 1084,
        "text": "Right. And there's another issue. The system compares teams, so people hide problems to look good. If a team admits a mistake, they get a lower score.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "78b26bab597d2861c6248df8df965ba27a179267a88f0b0489f1bf8ea124cda1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1091,
        "sourceEnd": 1168,
        "text": "That's dangerous. It encourages people to hide errors instead of fixing them.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "ac43ebc5de475196b6195758890eb40187703d809cf43d824df114f14a1d9f18",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1174,
        "sourceEnd": 1263,
        "text": "Yes. And the worst part is that Rachel doesn't see this. She only looks at the dashboard.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "3fb3bd0061556f6f72c99afce45225c17b311a3c79220a37a80913cfffe9aa91",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1270,
        "sourceEnd": 1302,
        "text": "Have you talked to her about it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "e98293d05a630ffcab444a6c1a7233bf70029c29e7a6a7b2209d8f35ab477e23",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1308,
        "sourceEnd": 1391,
        "text": "I tried. But she said the system is fair because everyone is measured the same way.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "d77800edfa4deedccde14ea903d2d247989cc04648180a9857f4e40e79679fe7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1398,
        "sourceEnd": 1779,
        "text": "Hmm. That's a common argument, but it's not quite right. Measuring everyone the same way doesn't mean the measurement is fair if the work is different. For instance, if one team handles complex cases and another handles simple ones, the same metrics can't capture that difference fairly. Fairness in measurement depends on whether the metrics reflect the actual demands of the job.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7131cbb14fed4327bf9d5a1478722a77a74b44778060a3332025db8f8e6b0efd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1785,
        "sourceEnd": 1838,
        "text": "That's a good point. I hadn't thought of it that way.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "065c0d29c52cfc9f152bf736ed90d9ead59283f08ab6df3e82a1d99fab08499f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1845,
        "sourceEnd": 1997,
        "text": "What if you suggested a small change? For instance, add a quality check to the system, or ask for a monthly team discussion about what the numbers miss.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "45d05adbd7076c69b552a864f3114fbaee4c34a5bf899f1e676f6c519bda629a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 2003,
        "sourceEnd": 2101,
        "text": "That could work. But I'm not sure Rachel will listen. She's under pressure from senior management.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "2e7da56b91e56cc2c843977be33ad7531d24af4e37064e4ffb0c0873754e8a11",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2108,
        "sourceEnd": 2264,
        "text": "Maybe you could frame it as a way to improve the system, not as a criticism. If you show her that the current system hides problems, she might be more open.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "6e20f22dd383983aec46f185cfaedb091dacae059d3d19435a4de8e8999bf861",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 2270,
        "sourceEnd": 2355,
        "text": "So instead of saying \"the system is bad,\" I could say \"here's how to make it better.\"",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "a421dd9791fbb4dcff19e2cb0c1ae6901dd0d13d34a908864ef97a833c9047bf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2362,
        "sourceEnd": 2463,
        "text": "Exactly. And you could bring examples from your team. Real stories are more convincing than opinions.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "db8212bee711ea9f017aa2fb3c037eeb456ca970cc8b1aaaf9546125b73d041c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 2469,
        "sourceEnd": 2561,
        "text": "OK. I'll prepare a short document with two or three examples. But what if she still says no?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "07cd9e8e3d4e596eed2363fa6cd153d65f40b1f29775ab31a8bd15c21192ecca",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2568,
        "sourceEnd": 2714,
        "text": "Then at least you've raised the issue. And you could ask for a trial period for the new idea. A trial is less threatening than a permanent change.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "9ee6f471ede157b43e0bd38fa2f342fb3c118938e29287ecf43b0c8e52906da2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 2720,
        "sourceEnd": 2774,
        "text": "That makes sense. I feel better already. Thanks, Maya.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "41219f797a7e55c0a52e430e954a405dfee9d5b198cc5ba6a3f904a3f03aeec5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2781,
        "sourceEnd": 2817,
        "text": "No problem. Let me know how it goes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "84db42db8561b275c7dcf920a5e56a9b5e88c89b66d7648ac6051052a2d41082",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
